@host = http://localhost:5000

### Health
GET {{host}}/api/health
Accept: application/json

### Create incident
POST {{host}}/api/incidents
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Payment API elevated latency",
  "description": "p99 latency on /checkout exceeded 2s after the redis failover. Downstream timeouts observed on order-service.",
  "systemName": "payments-api",
  "severity": "high"
}

### Get incident
GET {{host}}/api/incidents/00000000-0000-0000-0000-000000000000
Accept: application/json

### Ask / analyze with filters
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/ask
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queryText": "What caused checkout latency after redis failover?",
  "systemName": "Radar-APG",
  "minSeverity": "High",
  "topK": 4
}

### Analyze alias
POST {{host}}/api/incidents/analyze
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "queryText": "Summarize UAV RF jamming mitigations",
  "systemName": "UAV-Link-X",
  "minSeverity": "Medium",
  "topK": 3
}
